{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38680","headline":"上裴侍郎 · 王涣","name":"上裴侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青衿七十牓三年，建礼含香次第迁。\n珠彩下连星错落，桂花曾对月婵娟。\n玉经磨琢多成器，剑拔沈埋更倚天。\n应念衔恩最深者，春来爲寿拜尊前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}